{"dependencies":[{"id":"inventarch/language","range":"^3.2.0"}],"description":"The IA KB kit, the Knowledge lane's public default: where organisation and repository knowledge lives, where a user's workspaces are saved (~/Documents/ia/<name> by default, never inside ~/.ia), and how a @spec anchor stays bound to one exact body, current, checked and reviewed. An entry capability whose playbook is a whole orient, plan, act and learn procedure; one capability and playbook per stage (place content, bind a document, maintain a document, check, migrate) plus retrieval and review; conventions for placement, workspace location, binding and the locator manifest, lifecycle, role briefs, host adaptation, IA reads and evidence reporting; laws for the blocking rules; librarian, reviewer, curator and gate-runner profiles; declared checks for admission, the decision lifecycle and locator manifests; a contract with cases; and the references, the split-body example and both checkers as assets.","distribution":"workspace-system/definition/distribution/ia-kb-distribution","engine":"^0.1.1","files":[{"bytes":7766,"path":".ia/src/systems/ia-kb/records/capabilities.ia","role":"source","sha256":"6e1e1bc0dfac0b49868a9fc11f373071df678b705ac0ab16c75c6e1f2ca7b349"},{"bytes":29502,"path":".ia/src/systems/ia-kb/records/compliance.ia","role":"source","sha256":"bb2f9122d9c3c63be794b9ca9dd480d39e027ed91b17b0917b487a48e4b248ce"},{"bytes":16637,"path":".ia/src/systems/ia-kb/records/conventions.ia","role":"source","sha256":"4aca2a34666769f09fb83bee38c47d0eacfa6457b9042d158bb62693d1c0a2ab"},{"bytes":318,"path":".ia/src/systems/ia-kb/records/distribution.ia","role":"source","sha256":"cb1e1fe98639cb4d13d73cef1a93aaea92b746516eeebed49e4f67608c89f94f"},{"bytes":5407,"path":".ia/src/systems/ia-kb/records/laws.ia","role":"source","sha256":"2646ae7a3d673fe070db495a6bed9f4ab5b4233b9ebd9bb5ee555dfe5192ca74"},{"bytes":35565,"path":".ia/src/systems/ia-kb/records/playbooks.ia","role":"source","sha256":"72216c026b48